==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*svobodьnъ}}. Parsable as {{af|ru|свобо́да|-ный}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|свобо́дный}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-свободный.ogg}}

===Adjective===
{{ru-adj|свобо́дный}}

# [[free]] (not subject to limitations, not subject to rigid control)
# [[free]], [[unrestricted]], free [[access]]
# [[free]], [[vacant]], [[unoccupied]], [[empty]], [[spare]]
#: {{syn|ru|вака́нтный}}
# [[loose]], [[spacious]], loose-fitting
# {{lb|ru|chemistry}} [[free]], not bound to other elements, free valence.
# {{lb|ru|chiefly|software|and|artworks}} [[libre]]

====Declension====
{{ru-decl-adj|свобо́дный|a*}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|ru|во́льный}}, {{l|ru|неограни́ченный}}
* {{l|ru|беспрепя́тственный}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|свобо́да|t=liberty, freedom}}, {{l|ru|освободи́тель|t=liberator}}, {{l|ru|освобожде́ние|t=liberation}}
* {{l|ru|освободи́ть|t=liberate}}
